{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/HardwareRouterAndMemory"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/HardwareRouter","doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/WiredMemoryManager","doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/WiredMemoryTicket"],"title":"Memory & Routing APIs","anchor":"Memory--Routing-APIs"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple Silicon features a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unified Memory Architecture (UMA)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" where the CPU, GPU, and Apple Neural Engine (ANE) share a single high-bandwidth memory pool. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftPreprocessing"},{"type":"text","text":" provides intelligent hardware routing and memory reservation primitives to prevent GPU saturation and avoid data copying."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"1-The-Hardware-Router","type":"heading","text":"1. The Hardware Router","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"HardwareRouter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" assesses tensor dimensions and operation complexity to select the optimal computing engine:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["graph TD","    Op[Compute Operation] --> Router{HardwareRouter}","    Router -->|Small \/ Vector < 50k| CPU[Accelerate \/ AMX \/ NEON]","    Router -->|Large Matrix \/ Autodiff| GPU[MLX Metal GPU]","    Router -->|Static Inference| ANE[Core ML Engine]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"mermaid"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Small Vectors ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N < 50,000"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Routed to CPU Accelerate (vDSP\/BLAS\/LAPACK) to eliminate GPU kernel dispatch latency.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Large Tensors & Deep Learning"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Routed to MLX Metal GPU for massive parallel throughput.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"2. WiredMemoryManager & Ticket System","anchor":"2-WiredMemoryManager--Ticket-System","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To prevent out-of-memory (OOM) conditions during concurrent analytical workloads, ","type":"text"},{"code":"WiredMemoryManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implements an asynchronous FIFO reservation system:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftPreprocessing","","\/\/ Acquire a GPU execution slot","let ticket = try await WiredMemoryManager.shared.reserveMemory(estimatedBytes: 64 * 1024 * 1024)","","\/\/ Execute heavy MLX operations","\/\/ ...","","\/\/ Automatically flushes GPU caches upon completion","await ticket.release()"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftPreprocessing"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Hardware Routing & Unified Memory Governance"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftpreprocessing\/hardwarerouterandmemory"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Understand how SwiftSci automatically routes workloads between CPU (Accelerate\/AMX\/NEON) and Metal GPU (MLX) with strict concurrency safety.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://SwiftPreprocessing/documentation/SwiftPreprocessing/HardwareRouter":{"title":"HardwareRouter","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftPreprocessing\/documentation\/SwiftPreprocessing\/HardwareRouter","abstract":[{"text":"Serializes device selection and MLX default-d